Package: lczexplore
Title: Import, Visualize, Compare, and Explore Local Climate Zone Maps
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Matthieu", "Gousseff", email = "matthieu.gousseff@cnrs.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7106-2677", affiliation = "Centre National de la Recherche Scientifique, Lab-STICC"))
Description: Import and visualize local climate zone (LCZ) maps with standard encoding. Compare two or more maps and group LCZ types accordingly. Explore differences through circular visualizations and indicators.
License: LGPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
